{"metadata":{"name":"Sunan Abu Dawud","section":{"14":{"eng-name":"Fasting (Kitab Al-Siyam)","ara-name":"كتاب الصوم"}},"section_detail":{"14":{"hadithnumber_first":2313,"hadithnumber_last":2476,"arabicnumber_first":2313,"arabicnumber_last":2476}}},"hadiths":[{"hadithnumber":2462,"arabicnumber":2462,"text":"Aishah رضي الله عنها a dit : Le Prophète ﷺ faisait la retraite spirituelle (i’tikaf) à la mosquée pendant les dix derniers jours de Ramadan jusqu’à ce qu’Allah le rappelle à Lui, puis ses épouses ont fait la retraite spirituelle à la mosquée après sa mort","grades":[{"name":"Al-Albani","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Muhammad Muhyi Al-Din Abdul Hamid","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Shuaib Al Arnaut","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Zubair Ali Zai","grade":"Sahih Bukhari (2026) Sahih Muslim (1172)"}],"reference":{"book":14,"hadith":150},"chapter":{"id":78,"ara-name":"باب الاِعْتِكَافِ","eng-name":"Al-I'tikaf","isFirstHadith":true}}]}